EMPLOYEE HANDBOOK

1. Working Hours
Normal working hours are 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM, Monday to Friday.

2. Attendance
Employees are expected to maintain regular attendance and inform their manager when they are unable to attend work.

3. Leave
Employees receive 24 days of paid leave per calendar year.

4. Remote Work
Employees may work remotely up to 2 days per week with manager approval.

5. Code of Conduct
Employees must maintain professional behavior and respect colleagues.

6. Information Security
Employees must not share company confidential information with unauthorized individuals.

7. Company Equipment
Company laptops and other equipment must be handled responsibly and returned when employment ends.